## Result up front

The Block-10 shell cannot play two roles at once under the most literal
quantum-channel reading tested here.  If its six qubits are earlier permanent
Records and their complete joint quantum state must remain unchanged, no
physical channel can also make a fresh shell depend on their nine continuous
coordinates.  The only possible extension leaves the old shell untouched and
appends one fixed, input-independent state.

The exact terminal is **Record-program `EMPTY`**.  This is not a no-go for causal preparation.
It is a no-go for one displayed realization:

```text
the same noncommuting six-M2 product shell
  + complete quantum prefix preservation
  + a separate exact rank-nine output shell.
```

The capacity itself survives.  If the old shell is a consumable live condition
rather than a permanent Record, an identity/SWAP relay carries all nine
coordinates exactly.  If the Record alphabet is orthogonal and classical, a
CNOT copies it without disturbance.  If exactness and preservation are relaxed,
the symmetric universal cloner carries both marginals with Bloch shrink
`2/3`.  Those controls are why the result is a narrow route boundary rather
than TOE closure.

